---
---

<div class="eng-card">
  <div class="eng-card-header">
    <div class="eng-card-title">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path d="M3 3v18h18"></path>
        <path d="M7 16c2-4 5-8 7-8s4 6 7 2"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>Pressure - Volume (P-V) Indicator Diagram</span>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-controls">
      <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm pv-mode-btn active" data-mode="realistic">Actual Cycle</button>
      <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm pv-mode-btn" data-mode="ideal">Ideal Otto</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-canvas-wrapper">
    <canvas id="pv-canvas" width="600" height="340" class="eng-canvas"></canvas>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-footer-note">
    <span class="note-bullet">●</span>
    <span class="note-text">
      The enclosed area inside the P-V loop represents the net indicated mechanical work per cycle:
      <code>W = ∮ P · dV</code>. In actual engines, rounding at corners occurs due to finite flame speed, blowdown, and heat transfer.
    </span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .chart-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .pv-mode-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent-cyan);
    color: #04101e;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .chart-canvas-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    background: #090d16;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .eng-canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .chart-footer-note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .note-bullet {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .chart-footer-note code {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
</style>

